  "prompt": "Evaluate $$\\int_1^\\infty\\frac1{2025^{\\lfloor x\\rfloor}}\\,dx$$",
  "image": null,
  "choices": null,
  "answer": "1/2024",
  "acceptedAnswers": null,
  "answerUnit": null,
  "answerDisplay": "$\\frac1{2024}$",
  "solutions": [
   {
    "title": "Solution",
    "body": "On $[k,k+1)$ the integrand is $2025^{-k}$, so the integral is $\\sum_{k\\ge1}2025^{-k}=\\frac{1/2025}{1-1/2025}=\\frac1{2024}$.\n\n**Answer: $\\frac1{2024}$**"
   }
  ],
